<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/sha512> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SHA-2 with a digest length of 512, as defined in [RFC 6234](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc6234/)."@en .
